+
+## `POST /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions`
+
+Registers the current browser to receive the user’s notifications. A user can only register a subscription for themselves.
+
+__Request:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "push_subscription": {
+    "endpoint": "https://push.example.com/subscriptions/device-token",
+    "p256dh_key": "browser-public-key",
+    "auth_key": "browser-auth-secret"
+  }
+}
+```
+
+Posting an existing endpoint refreshes its keys. Returns `201 Created` with the subscription ID:
+
+```json
+{
+  "id": "03f5va03bpuvkcjemcxl73ho2"
+}
+```
+
+## `DELETE /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions/:id`
+
+Stops push notifications for the registered browser. Returns `204 No Content` on success.
